WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.182 --> 00:00:04.216
GOOD EVENING.

00:00:03.615 --> 00:00:05.617
WELCOME TO THE SHOW.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.985
YOU JUST HEARD FROM THE

00:00:05.751 --> 00:00:06.952
PRESIDENT.

00:00:06.118 --> 00:00:08.454
RIGHT NOW, THOUGH, WE HAVE A

00:00:07.086 --> 00:00:11.056
RARE FIRSTHAND ACCOUNT FROM THE

00:00:08.587 --> 00:00:13.092
CENTER OF MAYBE THE GREATEST

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:14.460
SCANDAL IN MODERN POLITICAL

00:00:13.225 --> 00:00:15.794
HISTORY, THE FBI SPYING ON THE

00:00:14.593 --> 00:00:16.595
2016 TRUMP CAMPAIGN FOR NEARLY

00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:17.596
TWO YEARS.

00:00:16.729 --> 00:00:19.131
OBAMA ADMINISTRATION OFFICIALS

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:22.234
AND THEIR DO YOU TELLIFUL

00:00:19.264 --> 00:00:23.035
LACKEYS IN THE PRESS DENIED THAT

00:00:22.368 --> 00:00:25.237
HAPPENED.

00:00:23.168 --> 00:00:27.373
NOW WE DO KNOW THAT IT HAPPENED.

00:00:25.371 --> 00:00:28.340
THE OBAMA ADMINISTRATION USED

00:00:27.506 --> 00:00:29.108
GOVERNMENT AGENCY TO SURVEY A

00:00:28.474 --> 00:00:30.809
RIVAL CAMPAIGN.

00:00:29.241 --> 00:00:32.678
THERE'S NO DENYING THAT.

00:00:30.943 --> 00:00:33.779
SO INSTEAD THE USUAL APOLOGISTS

00:00:32.811 --> 00:00:34.913
ARE CLAIMING IT WAS A GOOD

00:00:33.912 --> 00:00:35.481
THING, IN FACT, SPYING ON TRUMP

00:00:35.047 --> 00:00:37.349
TO PROTECT HIM.

00:00:35.614 --> 00:00:38.617
BY THE WAY, YOU HAVE NO RIGHT TO

00:00:37.483 --> 00:00:40.853
KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT IT.

00:00:38.751 --> 00:00:42.621
EVEN ASKING QUESTIONS, A SIGN OF

00:00:40.986 --> 00:00:43.122
DISLOYALTY, SHUT UP AND OBEY.

00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:44.189
NO THANKS.

00:00:43.255 --> 00:00:45.557
TONIGHT WE HAVE A DIRECT ACCOUNT

00:00:44.323 --> 00:00:47.359
OF WHAT HAPPENED, THE FIRST FULL

00:00:45.691 --> 00:00:48.460
INTERVIEW WITH A TRUMP CAMPAIGN

00:00:47.526 --> 00:00:50.462
OFFICIAL APPARENTLY TARGETED BY

00:00:48.594 --> 00:00:54.233
AN FBI SPY.

00:00:50.596 --> 00:00:55.401
TIM CLOVIS WAS A FORMER NATIONAL

00:00:54.366 --> 00:00:55.901
CO-CHAIRMAN OF THE TRUMP

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:57.236
CAMPAIGN.

00:00:56.035 --> 00:00:59.671
IN 2016, HE HAD A FACE-TO-FACE

00:00:57.369 --> 00:01:02.174
MEETING WITH A MAN BELIEVED TO

00:00:59.805 --> 00:01:03.675
BE WITH ONE OF THE FBI SPIES ON

00:01:02.307 --> 00:01:05.844
THAT CAMPAIGN.

00:01:03.809 --> 00:01:07.479
SAM CLOVIS JOINS US.

00:01:05.978 --> 00:01:09.381
THANKS FOR COMING ON.

00:01:07.613 --> 00:01:15.988
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME ON.

00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:16.588
&gt;&gt; YOU BELIEVE YOU HAD A

00:01:16.121 --> 00:01:17.222
FACE-TO-FACE ENCOUNTER.

00:01:16.722 --> 00:01:20.292
DESCRIBE THAT MEETING.

00:01:17.356 --> 00:01:24.296
&gt;&gt; SEVERAL DAYS BEFORE THE

00:01:20.426 --> 00:01:25.664
SEPTEMBER 1st MEETING I HAD AN

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:30.936
OPPORTUNITY TO RECEIVE EMAILS

00:01:25.798 --> 00:01:32.337
FROM STEVEN HALPER, SAYING HE

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.639
KNEW CARTER PAGE, AND ASKED FOR

00:01:32.471 --> 00:01:36.809
A SIT-DOWN WITH ME.

00:01:33.772 --> 00:01:38.577
HE WANTED TO COME IN AND DISCUSS

00:01:36.942 --> 00:01:40.579
FOREIGN POLICY AND TO PROVIDE

00:01:38.844 --> 00:01:42.714
SOME -- WHAT HE THOUGHT MIGHT BE

00:01:40.712 --> 00:01:43.816
HIS -- SOME OF HIS WRITINGS THAT

00:01:42.848 --> 00:01:46.151
WOULD BE ABLE TO CONTRIBUTE,

00:01:43.949 --> 00:01:48.353
HELP US, IN THE CAMPAIGN.

00:01:46.285 --> 00:01:50.422
I ARRANGED THAT MEETING.

00:01:48.487 --> 00:01:52.791
WE HAD THAT MEETING IN

00:01:50.556 --> 00:01:53.158
WASHINGTON, D.C. ON THE 1st OF

00:01:52.925 --> 00:01:54.226
SEPTEMBER.

00:01:53.292 --> 00:01:57.029
IT LASTED ABOUT AN HOUR.

00:01:54.359 --> 00:02:01.233
HAD THE OPPORTUNITY TO DISCUSS

00:01:57.162 --> 00:02:02.234
OVER COFFEE WITH HIM HIS

00:02:01.366 --> 00:02:03.202
RESEARCH, AND IT WAS MOSTLY

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:04.937
FOCUSED ON CHINA.

00:02:03.335 --> 00:02:06.171
THEN I THINK AFTER THAT MEETING,

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.573
AND THEN ON THE 27th OF

00:02:06.305 --> 00:02:09.608
SEPTEMBER I RECEIVED AN EMAIL

00:02:07.706 --> 00:02:10.008
FROM HIM WITH SEVERAL

00:02:09.741 --> 00:02:12.244
ATTACHMENTS.

00:02:10.142 --> 00:02:13.445
I CAN BE HONEST WITH YOU,

00:02:12.377 --> 00:02:15.347
TUCKER, I HAVEN'T EVEN OPENED

00:02:13.579 --> 00:02:19.251
THOSE ATTACHMENTS TO THIS DAY.

00:02:15.481 --> 00:02:20.385
I HAVE NO IDEA WHAT WAS IN THEM,

00:02:19.384 --> 00:02:21.086
BUT MOSTLY PAPERS TITLED THAT

00:02:20.519 --> 00:02:24.323
DEALT WITH CHINA.

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:27.626
I THINK HE USED MY MEETING AS

00:02:24.456 --> 00:02:28.627
A -- USING MY MEETING AS A BONA

00:02:27.759 --> 00:02:30.028
FIDE WITH GEORGE PAPADOPOULOS,

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:31.763
TO HAVE A MEETING WITH HIM, THAT

00:02:30.162 --> 00:02:32.598
I DID NOT KNOW ABOUT, THAT WAS

00:02:31.897 --> 00:02:35.033
SUBSEQUENT TO MY MEETING WITH

00:02:32.731 --> 00:02:39.204
HIM ON THE 1st OF SEPTEMBER.

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:39.538
&gt;&gt; SO YOU DIDN'T KNOW HIM

00:02:39.338 --> 00:02:40.806
BEFORE?

00:02:39.671 --> 00:02:46.512
HE EMAILED YOU COLD?

00:02:40.939 --> 00:02:51.383
&gt;&gt; NO, I DID NOT.

00:02:46.645 --> 00:02:52.885
I JUST GOT THE EMAIL THAT ASKED

00:02:51.517 --> 00:02:54.620
FOR THE MEETING, AND HE USED THE

00:02:53.018 --> 00:02:55.587
FACT THAT HE KNEW CARTER PAGE.

00:02:54.753 --> 00:02:56.889
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:02:55.721 --> 00:02:57.990
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE CARTER HAD BEEN

00:02:57.022 --> 00:02:59.458
ASSOCIATED WITH OUR CAMPAIGN.

00:02:58.123 --> 00:03:00.425
&gt;&gt; AT WHAT POINT DID YOU BEGIN

00:02:59.591 --> 00:03:02.961
TO SUSPECT HE WAS WORKING FOR

00:03:00.559 --> 00:03:03.862
THE FBI, SEEKING TO GATHER

00:03:03.095 --> 00:03:06.165
INFORMATION SURREPTITIOUSLY ON

00:03:03.996 --> 00:03:08.800
THE CAMPAIGN?

00:03:06.298 --> 00:03:10.402
&gt;&gt; WELL, OUR MEETING WAS LIKE

00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:12.104
TWO FACULTY MEMBERS IN THE

00:03:10.536 --> 00:03:13.172
FACULTY LOUNGE.

00:03:12.237 --> 00:03:16.508
I DIDN'T THINK ANY OF IT UNTIL I

00:03:13.305 --> 00:03:17.376
STARTED TO SEE THE REPORTING

00:03:16.642 --> 00:03:19.645
THAT CAME OUT RECENTLY.

00:03:17.509 --> 00:03:20.345
THEN I STARTED TO PUT TWO AND

00:03:19.778 --> 00:03:21.847
TWO TOGETHER.

00:03:20.479 --> 00:03:23.982
THEN IT MADE SENSE TO ME THAT HE

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:25.984
WAS PROBING TO FIND A WEAK SPOT

00:03:24.116 --> 00:03:27.486
IN OUR CAMPAIGN, SOMEONE WHO

00:03:26.118 --> 00:03:30.389
MIGHT BE VULNERABLE TO

00:03:27.619 --> 00:03:32.090
CONNECTING THINGS BACK TO THOSE

00:03:30.522 --> 00:03:34.426
ELUSIVE 30,000 EMAILS THAT

00:03:32.224 --> 00:03:36.094
SUPPOSEDLY THE RUSSIANS HAD.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:39.398
I REALLY THINK THAT'S WHAT HIS

00:03:36.228 --> 00:03:41.333
TASK WAS, WAS TO CREATE AN AUDIT

00:03:39.531 --> 00:03:42.901
TRAIL BACK TO THOSE EMAILS FROM

00:03:41.466 --> 00:03:44.736
SOMEONE IN THE CAMPAIGN OR

00:03:43.035 --> 00:03:45.537
SOMEONE ASSOCIATED WITH THE

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.240
CAMPAIGN SO THAT THEY COULD

00:03:45.671 --> 00:03:50.742
DEVELOP A STRONGER CASE FOR

00:03:48.407 --> 00:03:54.079
PROBABLE CAUSE TO CONTINUE TO

00:03:50.876 --> 00:03:54.513
ISSUE WARRANTS AND TO FURTHER AN

00:03:54.213 --> 00:03:55.981
INVESTIGATION.

00:03:54.646 --> 00:03:58.717
I REALLY FELT AFTER HEARING ALL

00:03:56.114 --> 00:04:01.420
OF THESE OTHER THINGS, LISTENING

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:04.056
TO THE REPORTS THAT I'VE READ,

00:04:01.553 --> 00:04:05.924
THAT THIS TRULY WAS AN EFFORT TO

00:04:04.189 --> 00:04:06.258
BUILD SOMETHING THAT DID NOT

00:04:06.058 --> 00:04:08.160
EXIST.

00:04:06.391 --> 00:04:08.727
I REALLY THINK THAT WAS WHAT HIS

00:04:08.293 --> 00:04:10.429
MISSION WAS.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:13.098
&gt;&gt; WHY HAVEN'T YOU READ THE

00:04:10.562 --> 00:04:16.001
ATTACHMENTS TO HIS EMAILS?

00:04:13.232 --> 00:04:17.970
&gt;&gt; WELL, ONE, I WAS BUSY.

00:04:16.134 --> 00:04:20.639
I WORKED 16-20 HOURS A DAY.

00:04:18.103 --> 00:04:23.208
WE ALREADY HAD A LOT OF HELP ON

00:04:20.772 --> 00:04:23.508
FOREIGN POLICY IN AREAS OF

00:04:23.342 --> 00:04:24.743
CHINA.

00:04:23.642 --> 00:04:27.479
I REALLY DIDN'T THINK THEY WERE

00:04:24.876 --> 00:04:28.480
GOING TO CONTRIBUTE TO ANYTHING.

00:04:27.613 --> 00:04:30.015
FRANKLY, I'VE GONE BACK AND

00:04:28.614 --> 00:04:30.916
REVIEWED ALL MY EMAILS.

00:04:30.148 --> 00:04:32.718
I DIDN'T REPORT THAT MEETING TO

00:04:31.049 --> 00:04:35.420
ANYONE IN THE CAMPAIGN, SO THE

00:04:32.851 --> 00:04:37.656
MEETING WAS OF NO CONSEQUENCE TO

00:04:35.554 --> 00:04:38.023
ME AS FAR AS ANYTHING YOU COULD

00:04:37.789 --> 00:04:40.492
REMEMBER.

00:04:38.156 --> 00:04:42.127
I'VE LOOKED THROUGH ALL OF MY

00:04:40.626 --> 00:04:43.829
PERSONAL EMAILS, EVERYTHING, AND

00:04:42.261 --> 00:04:44.096
I CAN'T FIND A RECORD OF IT AT

00:04:43.962 --> 00:04:45.631
ALL.

00:04:44.229 --> 00:04:47.366
&gt;&gt; INTERESTING.

00:04:45.764 --> 00:04:49.501
THAT MEETING MAY HAVE PLAYED A

00:04:47.499 --> 00:04:50.802
KEY ROLE IN A MUCH LARGER STORY.

00:04:49.635 --> 00:04:52.004
SAM, THANK YOU FOR THAT ACCOUNT.

